    else within limit
        Credit-->>SO: proceed with allocation
    end
    DB-->>UI: 200 OK
```

### 6.4 Invoices (`/invoices`) — OWNER (+ Stripe webhook)

**Cross-role correlation:** a paid invoice releases stock for shipment; the dashboard updates live over SSE — no polling.
